  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本作品采用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fchoosealicense.com%252flicenses%252fmit%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 许可证</a>！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此地图包含&nbsp;<strong>7 座岛屿</strong>！</p>\n<p>这是我第一次认真尝试制作 WorldPainter 地图。欢迎在评论区留下反馈！</p>\n<p>地图详情：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>世界大小：<strong>1024x1024</strong></li>\n<li>制作工具：<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.worldpainter.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">WorldPainter</a></strong></li>\n<li>包含洞穴：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">是</span></li>\n<li>包含大型洞穴：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">是</span></li>\n<li>包含裂谷：<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">否</span></li>\n<li>包含矿物：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">是</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>截图所用资源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Complementary Shaders (Unbound) -&gt; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-unbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-unbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Haubna\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Physics Mod (Pro)</a> -&gt; 用于实现水面细微的波纹效果</li>\n</ul>\n<p>世界特性 / 自定义物件：<br>- 树木：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fplanetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fpalm-tree-pack%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">棕榈树</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fplanetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fnative-trees-of-europe-template-repository-1779952%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">其他树木</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>- 地面装饰：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fplanetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fjud-s-custom-stones-bushes%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">灌木丛</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>MCPlanet 链接：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252f1-19-1024x1024-island-map%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/1-19-1024x1024-island-map/</a></p>",
